      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The development of more effective strategies for managing endodontic pain emergencies draws from the research of both clinicians and basic scientists. This review explores evidence-based approaches for managing endodontic pain emergencies and newly emerging pain management strategies based upon molecular, cellular and physiologic research into pain mechanisms."},
